    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d17-a8">

                <pb facs="0263" n="253" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv07/pg253"/>

                <head>Appendix H to HD–12</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Dantzig</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-07">7. 7. 19</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">To the Council of Four</p>
                <p>The Dantzig working classes are faced with a problem threatening their very
                    existence (as?) the local Authorities can arrange no prospects of work for the
                    future. Part of the factories, etc., are being, and will be, closed, owing to
                    lack of materials and power. The working classes will very shortly be starving,
                    and riots among the workers are to be feared, which will not be in the interests
                    of the new Free Town.</p>
                <p>Time presses, and the working classes therefore appeal to the Council of Four to
                    safeguard their working interests.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">The Committee of the Working Population of
                        Dantzig</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
